## 5. AI COACHING & BEHAVIORAL LOGIC (POWERED BY GEMINI FLASH)
- Plateau Logic: **7-day** moving average weight trend (Tab 4 analysis window). If stalling AND Sunday notes are OK, coach may suggest -150 kcal/day (prefer rest days) or +1000 steps/day.
- Sunday journal (Tab 2) is qualitative context for weekly metabolic adjustments: mood, wins, blockers, plus 1–5 scores for Faim / Énergie / Fatigue.
- If hunger ≥ 4 OR fatigue ≥ 4 OR energy ≤ 2 (Sunday journal **or** any noted daily check-in): NEVER cut calories that week. Prefer maintain kcal + steps / recovery / easier intervals. Days **without** a daily note are ignored (do not invent 3/5).
- APIs:
  - `POST /api/coach-analysis` (Gemini Flash) — Tab 4 engine. Payload: 7-day `pesees` trend, latest Sunday `journal_notes`, daily check-ins (`logs_sante` kind=checkin, noted days only), planned + Strava-validated sessions, current targets / goal. Returns `analysis`, `nutrition[]`, `sport[]`, average + training/rest day macros. Fallback local rules if Gemini fails. NEVER dump raw API JSON (404, model names) in the UI.
  - `POST /api/coach-week` exists as a small fallback helper; **do not show a second coach card on Suivi**. Journal dimanche → confirmation → **Analyser dans Métabolisme**.
- **Tab 4 is the coach screen, not a second Suivi.** Weight charts, Renpho, Sunday journal, and sport routine stay on Tab 2 (no MilestoneBar). Tab 4 top: **Plan semaine** (`EnergyBalanceCard` histograms — Cible = `target_calories`, Dépense estimée = TDEE, Déficit/Surplus colored vs `primaryGoal`). Do not reuse Aujourd'hui copy (« Énergie du jour », Mangées, Brûlées). Then Faim/Énergie/Fatigue **gauges**, headline « à faire », action cards, kcal/macro deltas, selective apply. Never show BMR / TDEE labels. Flash models from live Gemini list (`lib/gemini/models.ts`). NEVER dump raw API JSON in the UI. No local mock bilan if Gemini fails — show a friendly error.
- Flexibility: Extra meals/cheats are spread over the next 3 to 4 days (-100 kcal/day adjustment).
- Tolerance: +/- 5% of daily calorie target is marked as "Goal Achieved".
- Recovery Logic: Suggest outdoor cycling or running based on habits, force rest days if high-intensity Strava workouts are detected in the last 48h.
- Qualitative Tracking: Daily 1-5 ratings for **Faim / Énergie / Fatigue** on Aujourd'hui, **just after meals** (save on tap, editable later; **Réinit.** clears today's scores; **Validé** when all three are set persists `payload.checkin.validated`). Days without a note are ignored by the 7-day coach. After Validé, **Coach du jour** (`lib/today-coach.ts`, rule-based, no Gemini) sits under that block and updates with eaten / remaining plan / sport vs planned session / feels. Hide the card until Validé. Sunday journal on Suivi still has mood / wins / blockers + weekly scores. Tab 4 gauges stay the Sunday journal; daily check-ins are extra 7-day signal.
- **Coach payload (Tab 2 → Tab 4):** saving a Sunday journal MUST persist `CoachWeekPayload` (`lib/coach-payload.ts`, localStorage `coach-week-payload`) containing: **7-day** weight trend (daily + MA7 + plateau flag), Sunday `journal_notes`, recent journals, **full `sport_routine`**, and profile goals. Destination `tab-4-metabolique`. Do NOT call Gemini Flash from the journal save — Tab 4 consumes the payload via **Demander l'analyse du Coach**. Show confirmation modal after save.
- **Tab 4 apply:** "Appliquer les ajustements" is **selective**. Checkboxes: **Nutrition** (default on, subtitle « Nouvelles cibles du jour · suggestions sur les repas ») writes `profils.target_*` + meal-gen bias (`coach-applied-targets`) for Tab 3; **Sport** (default on, subtitle « Ajuste durée / intensité des séances existantes. Ne crée pas de nouvelles séances. ») patches `profils.sport_routine` duration/effort — does not add sessions. Also writes `profils.applied_adjustments` (week_start Monday). After apply, a **recap that stays** on the card: cibles updated · suggestions on Aujourd'hui (logged meals not rewritten) · week plan updated / frozen if shopping fully checked / empty. Sport line if that domain was applied. Shared (duo) sessions stay in sync on both profiles.

### Tab 2 Suivi — dynamic goals & weight
- Weight goals are **per-profile** and editable (`Éditer mes objectifs`): start weight, target weight, primary goal (`perte` / `maintien` / `prise`), weekly rate.
- Persist on `profils`: `primary_goal`, `weekly_rate_kg`, `start_weight_kg`, `target_weight_kg` (also `current_weight_kg` from latest pesée).
- Weight card: open-bottom **270° arc** (`WeightJourneyChart`). Left = Départ in blue (`#5AC8FA`), right = Cible in green (`#30D158`). Fill starts on the left and turns green as progress (`progressPct`) approaches the target. Current kg in the center. **No** second 25/50/75/100% milestone bar (redundant with the arc).
- Tendance poids **and** composition corporelle ranges: **[14 jours] | [1 mois] | [3 mois] | [Tout]**. Compute MA 7j / 14j on the **full series**, then slice the window (`sliceTrendRange`). Ranges stay tied to the active profile’s pesees.
- **Screen order (per profile):** header + Éditer mes objectifs → jauge poids → **Import Renpho** (once, first profile) → **journal du dimanche** → tendance poids → composition corporelle → lien Bilan Coach → **Ma routine sport last**.

### Tab 2 — Ma routine sport (`profils.sport_routine` jsonb)
- Rendered **last** on the Suivi screen (after charts and Bilan Coach). Caption: **Ici tu construis la semaine. Aujourd’hui et Métabolisme lisent cette même routine.**
- One JSON routine per profile. Derived counters `runsPerWeek` / `ridesPerWeek` / `strengthDays` / `targetMinutesPerWeek` are recomputed from `sessions` (do not maintain a second source of truth).
- Session object (persist these keys):
  - `id`, `activity`, `effort`, `durationMin`, `elevationM` (D+ in metres), `exercises[]`, `shared`, `weekdays[]` (ISO 1=Lun … 7=Dim, multi-select).
- **Activity:** `course` | `velo` | `muscu` | `equitation` (Équitation). UI groups cards by activity.
- **Effort (by activity):** Course/Vélo: Fractionné, Sortie longue, Endurance, Récupération / Zone 2, Trail. Muscu: Circuit HIIT, Force. Équitation: Endurance, Récupération / Zone 2 (extend as needed). D+ is a **numeric target on the session**, not an effort chip.
- **Exercises:** each row has `target`: `reps` (séries × répétitions) OR `temps` (isométrie / HIIT: `workSec` effort + `restSec` repos). Labels FR: « Répétitions / Durée », « Temps / Isométrie ».
- Visual dashboard: badges for duration, D+, effort, weekdays; Éditer / Supprimer; Ajouter une séance. Session builder is a sheet (Nouvelle séance / Éditer la séance).
- **Coach Flash on the routine:** `CardioPlanner` (`POST /api/coach-cardio`) proposes course/vélo slots from prefs; user applies → writes `sport_routine.sessions`. `HypertrophyPlanner` (`POST /api/coach-hypertrophy`) only if `primaryGoal === "prise"`. Copy: **Propose les séances. Tu valides → ça devient ta routine.** Both use Gemini Flash + `withGeminiWait`. Do not invent a second routine source. Tab 4 Sport **adjusts** duration/effort of existing sessions only.
- **Séance en duo (Alexis & Élodie):** toggle on the builder. `shared: true` + **same `id`** replicated on both `profils.sport_routine`. Badge **Duo**. Edit/delete of a shared session MUST prompt « Mettre à jour pour les deux profils ? » (both vs this profile only). Persist both rows in one `updateSportRoutines` write (avoid racing two catalog updates).
- Fallback: localStorage overlay if the `sport_routine` column is missing; parse must accept count-only JSON and synthesize sessions.

### Tab 2 — Sunday journal & Renpho
- Placed **just under** the weight/objectifs card (not at the bottom of Suivi).
- Sunday journal saves to `pesees.journal_notes` (JSON: mood, wins, blockers, hunger, energy, fatigue) on the Sunday weigh-in row. Unique `(profile_id, date)`.
- History drawer title: **Historique des notes**, sorted by date desc, loaded from Supabase `journal_notes IS NOT NULL` (merge local rows).
- Renpho OCR: Gemini Flash fills the review form for the selected profile + date (merge existing `pesees` row if the day already exists). Save to `pesees` ONLY after confirm.

---

## 6. CODE ARCHITECTURE
- Step-by-Step Generation: Build modularly (DB -> UI -> Features -> APIs).
- State Management: Use robust React state and `window.storage` for persistence.
- Zero Regression: Do not break existing UI when adding features. Ask for confirmation before refactoring.
- Dates: Europe/Paris (`lib/dates.ts`). Seed today + yesterday meals if today’s `repas` is empty.
- Data model (filter by `profile_id`, not Auth uid):
  - `profils`: `primary_goal`, `weekly_rate_kg`, `start_weight_kg`, `target_weight_kg`, `current_weight_kg`, **`sport_routine` jsonb**, **`meal_templates` jsonb**, `target_calories`, `target_protein_g`, `target_carbs_g`, `target_fat_g`, **`applied_adjustments` jsonb**.
  - `sport_routine` shape: `{ runsPerWeek, ridesPerWeek, strengthDays, targetMinutesPerWeek, sessions: [{ id, activity, effort, durationMin, elevationM, shared, weekdays, exercises: [{ id, name, sets, target, reps, workSec, restSec }] }] }`.
  - `repas` (incl. `is_skipped`).
  - `logs_sante`, `parametres` (single `foyer` row, **`favorite_recipes` jsonb**, **`rejected_recipes` jsonb**), `plans_semaine` (one JSON plan per Monday).
  - `pesees`: weight / body comp / Sunday **`journal_notes`**; unique `(profile_id, date)`.
- Tab 1 architecture: meals + Faim/Énergie/Fatigue (then **Coach du jour** if Validé) + **Séance du jour** from the selected profile’s `sport_routine` + weekday; Strava match via `lib/strava-match.ts`. Lunch/dinner **plat** auto-fills from this week’s `plans_semaine` (`lib/serve-week-plan.ts`, 1 portion) when the slot is empty, dessert-only, or a demo seed — never overwrite a logged plat; button **Mettre le plat de la semaine** to replace plat only (`withKeptDessert`). **Heart** (`FavoriteHeart`) and **Ban** (`RejectMealButton`) on déjeuner/dîner when `canFavoriteMeal(weekDish)` — full `PlannedMeal` snapshot for favorites; rejected is title/theme only (`lib/rejected.ts`). Same title re-heart updates the favorite. Ban and heart are exclusive. No heart/ban on PD / collation / dessert-only logs. Reset = templates PD/collation/dessert + week plat, no mock bowls. Desserts live on the same `dejeuner` / `diner` row (`Dessert :` prefix); cards + `EditMealSheet` split Plat vs Dessert. `fillMissingSlotsFromTemplates` / `applyTodaySlotTemplates` merge dessert templates from `profils.meal_templates` (and local overlay). Coach ingredient adds skip dessert lines (`lib/coach-ingredients.ts`). Applied coach diffs (`profils.applied_adjustments` jsonb, week-scoped) show coral **Ajustement Coach** badges. Nutrition badges translate daily macro deltas into **concrete ingredient adds**: staple **Idéal** (rule-based, next prep). **Rapide** = Gemini **Flash** `POST /api/coach-quick-add` fitted to **that** dish (no-prep, diet, aversions); **Autre idée** asks a new one (avoid list). Fallback pantry list if Flash fails. Do not rewrite overnight-oats grams on Today. Week plan / shopping still boosts the staple on remaining days. Sport: duration tags; dismiss via the badge X (or auto-hide a séance once Validé). Rings / macros / meal kcal use `lib/macro-status.ts` vs `primaryGoal`: green when on-track or helping (kcal under for perte, protein ≥95%), red when off-goal (kcal over for perte, under for prise). Tolerance ±5% kcal = achieved. Edit-meal sheet **Ajouter au plat** = 3 saisie rapide modes; skip slot picker; keep dessert lines. `TodayEnergyCard` on the dashboard. Logging: `POST /api/log-text`, `POST /api/log-photo` (Flash) behind `withGeminiWait`.
- Tab 2 architecture: pesees load/save (`lib/supabase/pesees.ts`); goals (`saveProfileGoals`) + sport (`saveSportRoutines`); journal history `loadJournalHistory`; coach payload `lib/coach-payload.ts` (7-day window). Weight arc `WeightJourneyChart` (open bottom, blue→green). Screen order: objectifs + arc → Renpho → journal → tendance → composition → bilan Coach → **routine sport last** (`SportRoutineCard` + `CardioPlanner` / `HypertrophyPlanner` if prise). Body-comp and weight charts share `RangeToggle` / `sliceTrendRange`.
- Tab 3 architecture: weekly plan UI + `POST /api/generate-meals` (Gemini Pro, `maxDuration` 300, wait overlay); `annotatePlan` → `expandPreparedSauces` (`lib/homemade-sauces.ts`) so loaded weeks explode jar sauces; shopping from `lib/shopping-from-plan.ts` (`shoppingDisplayName` merge + aisle fold `œ`→`oe`); Batch Master Plan from `lib/batch-from-plan.ts` (`buildBatchSession`) — packing = **Boîte Alexis / Boîte Élodie** + pot sauce, grams = 1 repas. Recipe chrome `RecipeTag` / `lib/plan-colors.ts` / `lib/ingredient-groups.ts` / `HoldTip`. On-screen guide + PDF share the same session object. Never invent a second week source — always the selected `week_start`. Pass **meal coach** (`lib/meal-coach.ts` from `profils.primary_goal` + `target_*` + dessert templates) so Gem Chef uses **per-profile** lunch/dinner kcal (dessert templates already subtracted) and `grams_alexis` / `grams_elodie` (same dish, different portions; perte = veg volume, prise = starch/protein density; protein never cut). Do NOT put desserts in Gem Chef recipes. Server `scalePlanToGoals` is the safety net if Gemini equalizes grams. Also pass applied Tab 4 bias (`loadHouseholdCoachBias`) so next-week generation respects applied coach targets. Active-week nutrition deltas also bump remaining plan grams + shopping extras (`lib/coach-plan-sync.ts`) **only if** the week’s shopping list is not fully checked. **Banner** if current targets/goals differ from the stamp saved at last generate / quantity update (`lib/plan-targets.ts`): *Cibles changées* → **Mettre à jour les quantités** (`scalePlanToGoals`, same recipes, no Gemini). **Plus tard** acknowledges until the next change. Empty week = no banner. **Favoris** (4th sub-tab): **Favoris | Plus jamais**. Household lists from Today lunch/dinner marks **and** the recipe sheet on Repas (`FavoriteHeart` / `RejectMealButton` on `RecipeDetailSheet`). Favoris: `lib/favorites.ts`, `parametres.favorite_recipes`. Plus jamais: `lib/rejected.ts`, `parametres.rejected_recipes` — Gem Chef + today-swap never regenerate those titles (`mergeAvoidTitles` into `pastMeals`); list is editable (title/theme, add by text, **Je change d’avis**). Ban does not delete the current week slot. Group by theme, search title/theme/ingredients. Open sheet: edit title/theme, Retirer, **Mettre dans la semaine** → `placeRecipeInSlots` + `scalePlanToGoals` (Lun–Ven = both batch pair slots). Same title re-heart updates the snapshot. No Gemini. Deep retouch = place on the week then existing swap/regen, then re-heart.
- Tab 4 architecture: `EnergyBalanceCard` (top) + `CoachAnalysisCard` + `POST /api/coach-analysis` (Gemini Flash); apply via selected domains → `updateTargets` (`profils.target_*` + `coach-applied-targets`) and/or `updateSportRoutines` (`sport_routine` duration/effort).
- Tab 5 architecture: `ParametresScreen`. (1) **Règles à respecter** : chips exclusifs `recipePace` + `heatStyle`, toggles foyer (tofu, simili, dîners low cal, météo, sauces maison), `extraRules` tags (+ critère libre). Aversions par profil. Matériel. `persistKitchenPrefs` → `parametres` (`kitchen_prefs` jsonb) + local `lib/kitchen-prefs.ts`. Gem Chef reads `formatKitchenPrefsForPrompt`. (2) **Petit-déj, collations & desserts** : `profils.meal_templates` (`lib/meal-templates.ts`) par profil, jours ISO comme `sport_routine`. Types : `petit-dejeuner` | `collation` | `dessert-midi` | `dessert-soir`. Tab 1 auto-remplit PD/collation vides ; desserts merge into `dejeuner` / `diner` (even logged meals if no `Dessert :` lines yet; skip if `Dessert : —` or dessert already present). Saving templates calls `applyTodaySlotTemplates(..., { replacePlan: true })`. **Never** replace saved `meal_templates` with `defaultMealTemplates` (skyr / oats démo) — defaults only if the column is null. (3) Connexions: `GET /api/connections` (booleans only, never secrets) + masked localStorage `api-keys`; webhook URL `{origin}/api/webhooks/health` (`?profile_id=alexis|elodie`, alias `/api/health-webhook`; GET + POST). Ingest → `logs_sante` (`kind=activite`, source `apple_health`) then Tab 1 Activité. (4) Thème: `useTheme().setScheme` (same as top-bar Moon/Sun). CTA **Enregistrer les préférences** + toast. PAS de routine sport / objectifs ici (Suivi).
- Theme: `ThemeProvider` wraps the app; CSS variables + `html.dark` overrides for `bg-white` surfaces and `bg-health-ink text-white` fills.
- Dev RLS: open `anon` + `authenticated` (`using (true)`). Tighten when household Auth lands.
- Code Quality: Keep components clean, without missing brackets, using realistic mock data for initial setup. Keep all secrets in `.env.local` (Supabase URLs, Webhook endpoints, Gemini API keys).
